---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — ChineseSnacks | Your Chinese Street Food Guide" description="ChineseSnacks privacy policy — how we handle your data. No tracking cookies, no analytics scripts, no advertising networks. Last updated for 2026." noindex>
  <Nav />
  <div class="min-h-[100dvh] pt-24 pb-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto w-full pt-16">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-accent mb-3">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-12">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="max-w-[65ch] space-y-8 text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-sm">
        <p class="text-base">Last updated: August 4, 2026</p>

        <p>ChineseSnacks ("we", "us", "our") operates the website chinese-snacks.com. This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our site.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>ChineseSnacks does not use tracking cookies, analytics scripts, or advertising networks. We do not collect personal information unless you voluntarily provide it (for example, when you email us with a snack suggestion or correction).</p>
        <p>The only data we may passively receive is standard server log information (IP address, browser type, pages visited) — this is standard for all websites and is not linked to any personally identifiable information.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Email Communications</h2>
        <p>If you contact us via email at hello@chinese-snacks.com, we will use your email address only to respond to your inquiry. We do not add you to mailing lists, newsletters, or marketing campaigns. We do not share your email address with third parties.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our site loads fonts from the Fontshare CDN (fontshare.com). Fontshare's privacy policy governs any data collected when your browser fetches these font files. We use no other third-party services, analytics, or ad platforms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">External Links</h2>
        <p>Our site may contain links to external sites. We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those sites.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our site does not address anyone under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes are effective immediately upon posting. We encourage you to review this page periodically.</p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at hello@chinese-snacks.com.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
